# ForgeClaw Cursor Rules

- Single source of truth: `/docs`
- Read before coding: `docs/PRD.md`, `docs/tech-stack.md`, `docs/architecture.md`, `docs/decisions.md`
- Keep changes small and reversible
- No new dependency without writing rationale in `docs/decisions.md`
- Do not change architecture boundaries without explicit approval
- Every task must define acceptance criteria and test plan
- If context is missing, ask first and avoid assumptions
